### 2.4 Root shell

`<html lang="en" data-theme="dark" className="dark" suppressHydrationWarning>`. Inline `THEME_INIT_SCRIPT` applies theme before hydration. Skip link `Skip to content` → `#main-content`. `QueryClientProvider` wraps `<Analytics />`, `<CookieConsent policyHref="/info/cookies" />`, then:

```tsx
pathname.startsWith("/sellers")
  ? <Outlet />
  : <Storefront focused={pathname.startsWith("/checkout")}><Outlet /></Storefront>
```

So checkout keeps the app CSS but hides global announcement/header/tabbar/footer. Sellers bypass the shared storefront shell entirely.

404: eyebrow `404 · PAGE NOT FOUND`, heading `We couldn’t find that page.`, body about broken/moved link, CTA `Back to SupreCart`.
Error: eyebrow `SOMETHING WENT WRONG`, heading `This page didn’t load.`, body, buttons `Try again`, `Go home`.

