### 3.2 Tailwind v4 entry

Top of `src/styles.css`:

```css
@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap");
@import "tailwindcss" source(none);
@import "tw-animate-css";
@source "../src";
@custom-variant dark (&:is(.dark *));
```

`source(none)` disables auto content detection; `@source "../src"` explicitly scans src. Dark mode is class-based (`.dark`).

Base Tailwind theme:
- `--font-sans: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif`
- `--color-card: #ffffff`, `--color-popover: #ffffff`, `--color-ring: #263b31`
