```ts
commissionTiers = [
  { id:"standard", range:"₦5,000 and below", summary:"₦150 + 7.5% of the selling price", flatFee:150, rate:0.075, min:0, max:5000 },
  { id:"premium", range:"Above ₦5,000", summary:"11% of the selling price", flatFee:0, rate:0.11, min:5000, max:null },
];
calculateCommission(price):
  tier = price <= 5000 ? standard : premium
  commission = min(roundKobo(price*rate + flatFee), price)
  sellerNet = roundKobo(price - commission)
  effectiveRate = price > 0 ? commission/price : 0
```
No listing or subscription fee. Guidance only; no backend enforcement.

